menuconfig MESHTASTIC_NEIGHBORINFO
	bool "Meshtastic neighbor info"
	default y
	help
	  The reference NeighborInfoModule: keeps a table of the nodes heard
	  DIRECTLY (a packet whose hop_limit still equals its hop_start), with
	  the SNR each was last heard at, and periodically broadcasts it as a
	  NeighborInfo on NEIGHBORINFO_APP (port 71) so the mesh -- and a phone
	  app or MQTT consumer -- can draw real topology instead of inferring
	  it from traceroutes. Off by default at runtime: the switch is
	  ModuleConfig.neighbor_info.enabled, set over the admin channel or
	  `meshtastic neighbors enable`; there is no AUTO_SEND Kconfig here
	  because the section's own `enabled` IS that switch. Also answers a
	  unicast want_response request with its table.

if MESHTASTIC_NEIGHBORINFO

config MESHTASTIC_NEIGHBORINFO_INTERVAL_SEC
	int "Default broadcast interval in seconds"
	default 21600
	range 60 604800
	help
	  Used when ModuleConfig.neighbor_info.update_interval is 0 (unset) or
	  below MIN_INTERVAL_SEC. The reference default is 6 hours.

config MESHTASTIC_NEIGHBORINFO_MIN_INTERVAL_SEC
	int "Smallest broadcast interval a stored config may ask for"
	default 14400
	range 60 604800
	help
	  A stored update_interval below this is replaced by INTERVAL_SEC, as
	  the reference does at set time (min_neighbor_info_broadcast_secs, 4 h)
	  -- here in the module's own resolver so every writer is clamped, not
	  only the admin path. The sim suite lowers it to run the cadence in
	  virtual time.

config MESHTASTIC_NEIGHBORINFO_TABLE_SIZE
	int "Neighbor table size"
	default 10
	range 2 32
	help
	  Direct neighbors tracked in RAM. A NeighborInfo carries at most 10
	  (the protobuf's bound); a larger table only changes which ones are
	  forgotten when a busy mesh has more than fit. When full, the least
	  recently heard neighbor is replaced.

config MESHTASTIC_NEIGHBORINFO_REPLY_SUPPRESS_SEC
	int "Minimum seconds between answered want_response requests"
	default 180
	range 1 86400
	help
	  The reference answers a NeighborInfo request at most once per three
	  minutes, whoever asks.

endif # MESHTASTIC_NEIGHBORINFO
